abstract: >
  An AI-native arsenal for testing web platforms. The deduplicated superset of 19 public security
  collections as of October 2026, plus 28 authored domains of method mapped onto 16 attack primitives,
  with verified install channels for 64 tools, decision trees as JSON, prompt packs, and a
  reconciliation ledger in which every excluded entry carries a reason.
